### CB-2 — No Database Indexes on Any FK or Query Field
**Files:** `supabase/migrations/` (all 5 files)
**Issue:** Every foreign key reference and every common WHERE clause field is unindexed. With the
current query patterns (filter by user_id, coach_id, player_id, status) all queries do full table
scans. Will degrade at ~50+ rows per table.
**Missing indexes (exhaustive):**
```sql
-- matches table
CREATE INDEX idx_matches_user_id ON matches(user_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_matches_logged_at ON matches(logged_at DESC);

-- coach_assessments table
CREATE INDEX idx_coach_assessments_coach_id ON coach_assessments(coach_user_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_coach_assessments_player_id ON coach_assessments(squad_player_id);

-- squad_players table
CREATE INDEX idx_squad_players_coach_id ON squad_players(coach_user_id);

-- session_attendance table
CREATE INDEX idx_session_attendance_session_id ON session_attendance(session_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_session_attendance_squad_player_id ON session_attendance(squad_player_id);

-- player_goals table
CREATE INDEX idx_player_goals_player_id ON player_goals(player_user_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_player_goals_status ON player_goals(status);

-- telemetry_events (if present)
CREATE INDEX idx_telemetry_user_id ON telemetry_events(user_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_telemetry_created_at ON telemetry_events(created_at DESC);
```
**Action:** Create migration `20260526_add_indexes.sql` with all the above.

