### CB-4 — No Error Monitoring / Production Logging
**Issue:** Only 3 `console.error` calls in 132 files. No remote error capture. You are completely
blind to what breaks in production.
**Action:** Add Sentry (free tier, easy Vite integration):
```bash
npm install @sentry/react
```
```tsx
// src/main.tsx
Sentry.init({
  dsn: import.meta.env.VITE_SENTRY_DSN,
  environment: import.meta.env.MODE,
  integrations: [Sentry.browserTracingIntegration(), Sentry.replayIntegration()],
  tracesSampleRate: 0.1,
  replaysOnErrorSampleRate: 1.0,
});
```
Add `VITE_SENTRY_DSN` to `.env`.

