## ⚠️ WARNING / RISK

### W-1 — tsconfig: Strict Null Checks Disabled
**File:** `tsconfig.json` (strict: false, no noImplicitAny, unused vars allowed)
**Risk:** Runtime `null` dereferences won't be caught at compile time. Supabase queries return
`data | null` — if code assumes data is always present and null is returned, app silently breaks.
**Action:** Enable `"strict": true` in `tsconfig.app.json` and fix resulting type errors.
This is a one-time cost with long-term reliability benefit.

