### W-3 — No Pagination on Data Lists
**Files:** All list pages (matches history, coach squad, assessments, goals)
**Risk:** Players who log 50+ matches will see increasingly slow loads. Supabase `.select('*')`
without `.range()` returns the full table matching the RLS filter.
**Action:** Add pagination to `useMatches`, `useAssessments`, `useGoals` hooks:
```typescript
const { data } = await supabase
  .from('matches')
  .select('*')
  .eq('user_id', userId)
  .order('logged_at', { ascending: false })
  .range(0, 19); // First 20 records
```
For pilot (30 users, ~10 matches each) this is low-urgency but a fast win.

