### W-5 — No Unhandled Promise Rejection Handler
**File:** `src/main.tsx`
**Risk:** Async errors not caught by try/catch (e.g., inside `useEffect`, `queryFn`) will silently
disappear in production if no global handler is attached.
**Action:**
```typescript
window.addEventListener('unhandledrejection', (event) => {
  Sentry.captureException(event.reason);
  event.preventDefault();
});
```

