### W-7 — No Input Sanitization on Free-Text Fields
**Fields affected:** club name, player notes, assessment notes, goal titles
**Risk:** Stored XSS if any text field is ever rendered with `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`. Currently one
instance exists in `src/components/ui/chart.tsx`. Low risk for now but grows as features expand.
**Action:** Add sanitization on insert for text fields using `DOMPurify`:
```typescript
import DOMPurify from 'dompurify';
const safeNote = DOMPurify.sanitize(rawNote, { ALLOWED_TAGS: [] }); // plain text only
```

