### W-11 — Onboarding Data in localStorage — No Expiry
**File:** `src/contexts/AuthContext.tsx` (`PENDING_PROFILE_KEY`)
**Issue:** Partial onboarding data is stored in localStorage without an expiry timestamp. If a user
abandons onboarding, stale data persists indefinitely and could cause incorrect state on their next
visit.
**Action:**
```typescript
const profileData = { ...data, savedAt: Date.now() };
// On read: if Date.now() - savedAt > 86400000 (24h), discard it
```

