## 🔵 NIT / ENHANCEMENT

### N-1 — No `.env.example` File
Create `.env.example` with placeholder values and comments explaining each variable.

### N-2 — No Pre-commit Hooks
ESLint is configured but not enforced on commit. Add `husky` + `lint-staged`:
```json
"lint-staged": { "*.{ts,tsx}": ["eslint --fix"] }
```

### N-3 — No Bundle Analysis or Code Splitting
Vite supports lazy loading via `React.lazy` + `Suspense`. The 24 Radix UI component imports could
be split into role-specific chunks (player bundle, coach bundle, parent bundle) to reduce initial
load time on mobile.

### N-4 — No PWA Manifest
`index.html` has no `manifest.json` link. For a "mobile-first" app that users are expected to use
weekly, adding a minimal PWA manifest (icon, name, `display: standalone`) costs < 30 minutes and
dramatically improves mobile UX.

### N-5 — axe-core / react-scan Dev-Only — No a11y Test Suite
Both tools run at startup in dev mode but there are no automated a11y tests in CI. The findings from
axe-core disappear when the dev console is closed. Add a smoke-test:
```typescript
// src/__tests__/a11y.test.tsx
import { axe } from 'jest-axe';
it('PlayerHome has no a11y violations', async () => {
  const { container } = render(<PlayerHome />);
  expect(await axe(container)).toHaveNoViolations();
});
```

### N-6 — No Data Retention / GDPR Deletion
Pilot will capture player performance data for minors (age groups visible in schema). No data
deletion flow exists — neither `DELETE /profile` in the app nor a documented off-boarding process.
Minimum: a "Delete my account" page that calls a Supabase RPC cascade-deleting all user data.

### N-7 — No Offline / Network Error Handling
When Supabase is unreachable, the app hangs silently. TanStack Query has built-in `networkMode`
and `retry` config. Set `networkMode: 'offlineFirst'` and add a toast on network failure.

### N-8 — Storybook Installed but Likely Outdated
`@storybook/react` v10.3.5 is installed. If stories haven't been updated post-implementation, many
will be broken. Run `npm run storybook` and fix failing stories before presenting to stakeholders.

### N-9 — `user-scalable=no` in viewport meta
**File:** `index.html`
`maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no` prevents accessibility users from zooming. Remove this
restriction — it also violates WCAG 1.4.4 (Resize Text).

